  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM. Enhancing Readmission and Legal Identity Capacity (RELICA). 2022-2023.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this programme is to enhance legal identity and readmission capacities in selected countries across the globe through ID management and assist them in improving their abilities to provide access to legal identity, thereby ensuring previously undocumented third-country nationals are better protected at home and on the move on the one hand, while facilitating the identification of irregular migrants in view of their readmission on the other.</narrative>
  </description>
